OL,3,GNEWSACouncil rejects bid to scrap
OL,4,Aschool transport changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to scrap a policy of only
OL,7,Fproviding free transport for children
OL,8,Fin North Yorkshire to their nearest
OL,9,Fschool instead of by catchment area has
OL,10,Fbeen narrowly rejected.
OL,12,FThe policy, which survived by three
OL,13,Fvotes at a council meeting on
OL,14,FWednesday, applies to children who
OL,15,Fstarted school from September 2025.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
