OL,3,GNEWSACouncil rejects bid to scrap
OL,4,Aschool transport changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FLib Dem Felicity Cunliffe-Lister, who
OL,7,Fproposed overturning it, said it was a
OL,8,F"Tory legacy that will continue to
OL,9,Fhaunt us", but Janet Sanderson,
OL,10,FConservative executive member for
OL,11,Fchildren and families, said opponents
OL,12,Fhad not come up with a costed
OL,13,Falternative.
OL,15,FDuring the meeting, councillors did
OL,16,Fvote to accept several changes
OL,17,Frecommended by officers in a
OL,18,Fpost-implementation review of the
OL,19,Fpolicy.
